---
title: Oat Flour Waffles
yields: 6%waffles
tags:
  - breakfast
source:
  name: Serious Eats
  url: https://www.seriouseats.com/buttermilk-vanilla-waffles-recipe
introduction: Makes 5–6 Eggo-sized waffles.
---

Preheat a #waffle iron{}.

Melt @butter{2%tbsp}.

Combine @oat flour{0.5%cup}, @baking powder{0.25%tsp}, @baking soda{0.25%tsp}, and @salt{0.25%tsp}.

Whisk in @egg{1}, @yogurt{0.5%cup}, @vanilla{0.5%tsp}, and the melted butter.

Cook in the waffle iron for ~{3%minutes}, until golden brown.
